{"nag":[{"c":"I don't mean to nag you.","cn":"我並不想嘮叨你。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2361351 (CK) & #13138161 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2361351"}],"nail":[{"c":"The nail tore his jacket.","cn":"這個釘子撕破了他的夾克。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #278607 (CK) & #840799 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/278607"}],"naive":[{"c":"I'm surprised that you're so naive.","cn":"我很惊讶你竟然那么天真。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2795064 (CK) & #469296 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2795064"},{"c":"I'm surprised you're so naive.","cn":"我很惊讶你竟然那么天真。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #7196718 (CK) & #469296 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/7196718"}],"naked":[{"c":"The boy was naked to the waist.","cn":"男孩赤裸着上身。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #46335 (CK) & #1324872 (vicch)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/46335"},{"c":"Tom is naked from the waist up.","cn":"汤姆赤裸着上身。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4944292 (CM) & #5114149 (musclegirlxyp)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4944292"}],"name":[{"c":"Can you name one of their songs?","cn":"你能够说出一首他们的歌的名字吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4144737 (Hybrid) & #4148180 (sissima)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4144737"},{"c":"Do you happen to know his name?","cn":"你說不定知道他的名字？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #69013 (CK) & #872119 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/69013"}],"nap":[{"c":"I may give up soon and just take a nap.","cn":"也许我会马上放弃然后去打盹。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #915342 (CK) & #25 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/915342"},{"c":"Tom says he needs a nap.","cn":"汤姆说他需要午睡。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1867933 (CK) & #8792844 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1867933"}],"napkin":[{"c":"May I have a napkin, please?","cn":"請給我一張餐巾紙好嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #36286 (CK) & #850354 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/36286"}],"narrow":[{"c":"The road is too narrow for cars.","cn":"這條路對汽車來說太窄了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #44680 (CK) & #895139 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/44680"},{"c":"There's narrow road to the village.","cn":"到村莊有條窄路。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #45550 (CK) & #798069 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/45550"}],"narrowly":[{"c":"He narrowly escaped being killed.","cn":"他險些被殺害。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #295005 (CK) & #834401 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/295005"}],"nasty":[{"c":"She gives me a nasty look every time she sees me.","cn":"她每次看見我都給露出厭惡的眼神。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #314306 (CK) & #5405477 (egg0073)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/314306"}],"nation":[{"c":"The President spoke to the nation on TV.","cn":"总统在电视上对国民讲话。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #275890 (CK) & #791425 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/275890"},{"c":"Every nation, rich or poor, has its strengths and weaknesses.","cn":"每个国家，无论贫富，都有其长，都有其短。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1577335 (CM) & #1577264 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1577335"}],"national":[{"c":"He's a professor at the National University.","cn":"他是国立大学的一名教授。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2258573 (_undertoad) & #4473128 (yuiyu)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2258573"}],"native":[{"c":"She is a native speaker of French.","cn":"她的母語是法語。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #312122 (CK) & #892515 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/312122"},{"c":"I'm not a native speaker.","cn":"我不是个母语者。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4620521 (CK) & #4620847 (Yashanti)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4620521"}],"natural":[{"c":"Acid rain is not a natural phenomenon.","cn":"酸雨不是自然现象。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #245182 (CM) & #334644 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/245182"},{"c":"Coal and natural gas are natural fuels.","cn":"煤和天然氣是天然燃料。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #681036 (Source_VOA) & #899994 (kanaorange)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/681036"}],"naturally":[{"c":"She naturally accepted the invitation.","cn":"當然，她接受了邀請。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #30523 (CM) & #873462 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/30523"}],"nature":[{"c":"Nature plays an important role in our life.","cn":"大自然在我们的生活中扮演着重要的角色。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #264462 (CM) & #1735628 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/264462"},{"c":"I'm an optimist by nature.","cn":"我天生是一個樂觀主義者。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #6873155 (CK) & #918033 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6873155"}],"nauseous":[{"c":"Do you feel nauseous?","cn":"你是否有噁心嘔吐的感覺。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4282468 (CK) & #6014700 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4282468"}],"navy":[{"c":"I went into the navy.","cn":"我加入了海軍。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #256592 (CK) & #786117 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/256592"},{"c":"Mary was wearing a navy blue skirt.","cn":"玛丽穿着深蓝色的裙子。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #8523273 (CK) & #8789329 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/8523273"}],"near":[{"c":"Can I catch a taxi near here?","cn":"我能在這附近打車嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #57207 (CK) & #6109339 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/57207"},{"c":"He lives in a village near Osaka.","cn":"他住在大阪附近一座鎮上。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2002408 (jackchak) & #884656 (Tajfun)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2002408"}],"nearly":[{"c":"I nearly fell off the cliff.","cn":"我差点从悬崖上掉下去。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #5298450 (CK) & #9931179 (tianblr)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5298450"},{"c":"I nearly left my umbrella on the train.","cn":"我幾乎把我的雨傘忘在火車上。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #8981994 (sundown) & #727495 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/8981994"}],"neat":[{"c":"That was pretty neat.","cn":"那真整潔。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4494736 (CK) & #6103222 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4494736"}],"necessarily":[{"c":"This work is not necessarily easy.","cn":"这项工作未必容易。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #59114 (CK) & #407299 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/59114"},{"c":"Large houses are not necessarily comfortable to live in.","cn":"大房子不一定适合住。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #275497 (CK) & #9970091 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/275497"}],"necessary":[{"c":"It isn't necessary to answer that letter.","cn":"沒有必要回那封信。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #495676 (CK) & #891987 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/495676"},{"c":"It's not necessary to answer that letter.","cn":"沒有必要回那封信。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #7198947 (CK) & #891987 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/7198947"}],"necessity":[{"c":"A computer is an absolute necessity now.","cn":"電腦現在是一個絕對必要的東西了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #54558 (CK) & #801309 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/54558"}],"neck":[{"c":"The horse broke its neck when it fell.","cn":"马倒下时脖子断了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #44518 (CK) & #10693366 (bmeecgkan)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/44518"},{"c":"He has a long neck.","cn":"他的脖子很長。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2266329 (_undertoad) & #4490372 (egg0073)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2266329"}],"necklace":[{"c":"My grandma gave me this necklace.","cn":"这条项链是我奶奶送给我的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2737507 (CM) & #2737442 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2737507"}],"need":[{"c":"A lot of people need our help.","cn":"一些人需要我們的幫助。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3162203 (CK) & #13266795 (mimosawang)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3162203"},{"c":"Do you need to work on Sunday?","cn":"你週日需要去工作嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #495532 (Swift) & #842244 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/495532"}],"needle":[{"c":"She's handy with a needle.","cn":"她擅长针线活。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10761326 (CK) & #12686976 (soueihin)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/10761326"},{"c":"It is like looking for a needle in a haystack.","cn":"这好比大海捞针。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #42533 (CK) & #5091981 (mirrorvan)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/42533"}],"neglected":[{"c":"He neglected his duties.","cn":"他怠忽職守了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #535249 (CK) & #825960 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/535249"}],"negotiation":[{"c":"The negotiation is off.","cn":"谈判中止了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #240296 (pierrephi) & #336100 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/240296"}],"neighborhood":[{"c":"He is getting along with his neighborhood.","cn":"他與他的鄰居相處。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #295433 (CK) & #804987 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/295433"},{"c":"There's a big supermarket in my neighborhood.","cn":"在我的邻近区域有一个大超市。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4490910 (AlanF_US) & #2615139 (fenfang557)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4490910"}],"neither":[{"c":"I can neither confirm nor deny that.","cn":"我既不能確認也不能否定。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2700655 (Hybrid) & #5933767 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2700655"},{"c":"I don't know and neither does he.","cn":"我不知道，他也不知道。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #392157 (CK) & #889654 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/392157"}],"nephew":[{"c":"My nephew is allergic to eggs.","cn":"我侄子對雞蛋過敏。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #250229 (CK) & #859442 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/250229"}],"nerve":[{"c":"She had the nerve to speak out.","cn":"她竟敢說出來。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #541126 (CK) & #893179 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/541126"}],"nervous":[{"c":"I always get nervous just before a match.","cn":"比赛前我一直都很紧张。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #263519 (CK) & #2029470 (ydcok)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/263519"},{"c":"I never make a speech without being nervous.","cn":"我没有一次演讲的时候是不紧张的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #256283 (Dejo) & #334782 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/256283"}],"net":[{"c":"He fixed the net.","cn":"他修好了网。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #304151 (CK) & #343783 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/304151"}],"neutral":[{"c":"Switzerland is a neutral country.","cn":"瑞士是一个中立的国家。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #52442 (CK) & #427562 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/52442"}],"never":[{"c":"A true gentleman never betrays his friends.","cn":"一个真正的绅士不会出卖他的朋友。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #520132 (kebukebu) & #333581 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/520132"},{"c":"Are you sure you've never met him?","cn":"你确定你没见过他吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #27466 (CH) & #11236322 (klzlueylx)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/27466"}],"new":[{"c":"A new school building is under construction.","cn":"一座新的教学楼正在建设。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #269145 (CK) & #10260791 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/269145"},{"c":"Auckland is a city in New Zealand.","cn":"奥克兰是一座新西兰的城市。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #427943 (witbrock) & #4265147 (notabene)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/427943"}],"new york":[{"c":"He went to New York by airplane.","cn":"他搭飛機到紐約了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #292326 (CK) & #883285 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/292326"},{"c":"He went to New York on business.","cn":"他去紐約出差了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #299510 (CK) & #885536 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/299510"}],"news":[{"c":"He heard the news on the radio.","cn":"他從收音機聽到了這個消息。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #290520 (CK) & #883473 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/290520"},{"c":"He is glad to hear the news.","cn":"他很高興聽到這個消息。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #291147 (CK) & #804961 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/291147"}],"newspaper":[{"c":"According to the newspaper, he committed suicide.","cn":"據報紙上說，他自殺了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #394269 (CK) & #864460 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/394269"},{"c":"I advertised my house in the newspaper.","cn":"我在报纸上刊登了我的房子的广告。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #258828 (CK) & #3043962 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/258828"}],"next":[{"c":"A beautiful girl sat next to me.","cn":"一個美麗的女孩坐在我旁邊。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #318148 (CK) & #873213 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/318148"},{"c":"He didn't know what to do next.","cn":"他不知道下一步要做什麼。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #264186 (CK) & #876734 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/264186"}],"nice":[{"c":"He gave a nice present to me.","cn":"他送给我一份漂亮的礼物。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #297673 (CK) & #512168 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/297673"},{"c":"He gave me a nice Christmas present.","cn":"他给了我一个很棒的圣诞礼物。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #297492 (CK) & #343671 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/297492"}],"nickname":[{"c":"Tom gave Mary that nickname.","cn":"汤姆给玛丽起的外号。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #6662189 (CK) & #8499973 (maxine)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6662189"}],"night":[{"c":"A fire broke out during the night.","cn":"在夜間發生了火災。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #323994 (CK) & #798279 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/323994"},{"c":"At night, she gazed at the moon.","cn":"她在夜晚望著月亮。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #534152 (CK) & #872431 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/534152"}],"nightmare":[{"c":"I had a really bad nightmare last night.","cn":"昨晚我做了一个可怕的噩梦。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2966872 (meerkat) & #4970087 (wzhd)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2966872"},{"c":"I feel as if I've woken up from a nightmare.","cn":"我覺得我好像從惡夢中驚醒。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #28527 (kebukebu) & #760862 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/28527"}],"nine":[{"c":"Can we meet tomorrow morning at nine?","cn":"在明天早上九点见可以吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10626064 (sundown) & #8734941 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/10626064"},{"c":"He said that it was nine o'clock.","cn":"他说九点了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #288667 (CK) & #812214 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/288667"}],"ninety":[{"c":"A right angle has ninety degrees.","cn":"直角是九十度。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #278236 (CK) & #1743564 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/278236"},{"c":"My grandfather lived to be ninety.","cn":"我的祖父活到了九十歲。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #251335 (CK) & #850120 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/251335"}],"no":[{"c":"Any bed is better than no bed.","cn":"任何床都比沒有床好。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #36682 (CK) & #801308 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/36682"},{"c":"As for me, I have no objection.","cn":"对于我，我不反对。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #255143 (CM) & #5842620 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/255143"}],"nobody":[{"c":"Nobody knows when the earthquake will occur.","cn":"没有人知道地震何时会来。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #65985 (CK) & #404458 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/65985"},{"c":"The bus stopped, but nobody got off.","cn":"巴士虽然停了，但是没有人下车。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2515245 (CK) & #2518641 (fenfang557)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2515245"}],"noise":[{"c":"Don't make noise when you eat soup.","cn":"當你喝湯的時候不要發出聲音。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #495876 (CK) & #875281 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/495876"},{"c":"I can't put up with this noise.","cn":"我不能忍受這個噪音。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #58020 (CK) & #833180 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/58020"}],"noisy":[{"c":"He admonished them for being noisy.","cn":"他告誡他們不要吵鬧。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #302571 (CM) & #778490 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/302571"},{"c":"Japan is an extremely noisy country.","cn":"日本是一個非常嘈雜的國家。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #281595 (CK) & #797037 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/281595"}],"none":[{"c":"Half a loaf is better than none.","cn":"半個麵包總比沒有好。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #34917 (CK) & #801302 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/34917"},{"c":"None of my classmates live near here.","cn":"我没有一个同学住在这儿附近。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #250651 (CK) & #333715 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/250651"}],"nonsense":[{"c":"What he says is total nonsense.","cn":"他说的话根本毫无意义。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1481674 (weihaiping) & #335127 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1481674"},{"c":"What nonsense are you talking now?","cn":"你胡说什么呢？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3732018 (CM) & #5819692 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3732018"}],"noon":[{"c":"He did not appear until about noon.","cn":"直到快要中午前他都沒出現。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #301550 (CK) & #875296 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/301550"},{"c":"I finished writing the letter by noon.","cn":"我中午前寫完這封信了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #259449 (CK) & #781128 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/259449"}],"nor":[{"c":"I can neither confirm nor deny that.","cn":"我既不能確認也不能否定。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2700655 (Hybrid) & #5933767 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2700655"},{"c":"I don't know, nor do I care.","cn":"我不知道，也不想知道。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #33482 (CM) & #332786 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/33482"}],"normal":[{"c":"This doesn't seem normal to me.","cn":"我看這不正常。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2400088 (CK) & #6111814 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2400088"},{"c":"Today's even busier than normal.","cn":"今天比平时还忙。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #8716818 (krrk) & #2442043 (fenfang557)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/8716818"}],"normally":[{"c":"This is the time he normally arrives.","cn":"他这个时候该到了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #58954 (CK) & #332953 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/58954"},{"c":"A sentence normally has a subject and a verb.","cn":"句子通常有主詞和動詞。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #320022 (CK) & #11969208 (corina)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/320022"}],"north":[{"c":"The wind is blowing from the north.","cn":"风从北边来。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #319712 (CK) & #2456086 (fenfang557)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/319712"},{"c":"Compass needles point to the north.","cn":"指南针的指针指向北边。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #264383 (CK) & #3470141 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/264383"}],"northern":[{"c":"Japan is located in the Northern Hemisphere.","cn":"日本位於北半球。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #281608 (CM) & #798334 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/281608"}],"nose":[{"c":"She pressed her nose against the glass.","cn":"她把鼻子贴在玻璃上。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1742338 (belgavox) & #8463527 (gumblex)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1742338"},{"c":"An elephant has a long nose.","cn":"大象有長鼻子。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #268258 (CK) & #795291 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/268258"}],"nosy":[{"c":"I didn't mean to be nosy.","cn":"我沒想多管閒事。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #5078207 (CM) & #13137886 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5078207"}],"not":[{"c":"Acid rain is not a natural phenomenon.","cn":"酸雨不是自然现象。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #245182 (CM) & #334644 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/245182"},{"c":"Africa is a continent; Greenland is not.","cn":"非洲是一個大陸, 而格陵蘭不是。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #67748 (Zifre) & #766465 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/67748"}],"note":[{"c":"He slipped me a note.","cn":"他悄悄地递给我一张纸条。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #297544 (CK) & #2440659 (fenfang557)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/297544"},{"c":"Tom says he left a note.","cn":"汤姆说他留了张便条。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3413225 (CK) & #5091297 (mirrorvan)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3413225"}],"notebook":[{"c":"He wrote it down in his notebook.","cn":"他把这记在他的笔记本上。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #255353 (CK) & #333745 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/255353"},{"c":"Let me have a look at your notebook.","cn":"請給我看一下你的筆記本電腦。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #9069623 (antonb) & #9057855 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/9069623"}],"nothing":[{"c":"He gave it to me for nothing.","cn":"他免費把它給了我。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #291497 (CK) & #805547 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/291497"},{"c":"He knows almost nothing about that animal.","cn":"他幾乎對那個動物一無所知。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #291194 (CK) & #788738 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/291194"}],"notice":[{"c":"I didn't notice the light turn red.","cn":"我沒有注意到燈變紅色了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #268847 (CK) & #880246 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/268847"},{"c":"He's bound to notice your mistake.","cn":"他必定會覺察到你的錯誤。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #288748 (CK) & #848965 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/288748"}],"noticeable":[{"c":"There are noticeable differences between the two.","cn":"两者之间有显著的差别。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #325629 (CK) & #8725728 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/325629"}],"noun":[{"c":"In this case, the adjective goes before the noun.","cn":"在这种情况下，形容词放在名词前面。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2267280 (_undertoad) & #5556077 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2267280"}],"novel":[{"c":"I read the novel in three days.","cn":"那部小说我看了三天。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2388650 (AlanF_US) & #10157004 (yeyue)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2388650"},{"c":"I spent last Sunday reading a novel.","cn":"我上週日花時間看了一本小說。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #534174 (CK) & #887706 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/534174"}],"now":[{"c":"A computer is an absolute necessity now.","cn":"電腦現在是一個絕對必要的東西了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #54558 (CK) & #801309 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/54558"},{"c":"Almost all the work is done now.","cn":"幾乎所有的工作都完成了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #245404 (CK) & #874226 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/245404"}],"nowadays":[{"c":"Everybody is immune to smallpox nowadays.","cn":"現今每個人都對天花免疫了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #241685 (CK) & #793345 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/241685"},{"c":"I almost never watch TV nowadays.","cn":"现在我几乎不看电视。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #6663537 (CK) & #7785257 (china_njlsc)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6663537"}],"nowhere":[{"c":"I have nowhere to go now.","cn":"我现在无处可去。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #8586777 (CK) & #8589665 (tianblr)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/8586777"},{"c":"Tom had nowhere to return to.","cn":"汤姆无处可归。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2069475 (marcelostockle) & #9969985 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2069475"}],"nuclear":[{"c":"All of us would like to get rid of nuclear weapons.","cn":"我們所有的人都想除掉核子武器。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #262941 (CK) & #830484 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/262941"}],"numb":[{"c":"The swimmers were numb with cold.","cn":"游泳選手們凍僵了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #26417 (CK) & #868389 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/26417"},{"c":"My right hand is numb.","cn":"我的右手麻了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #27064 (CK) & #834945 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/27064"}],"number":[{"c":"Can you give me your phone number?","cn":"你能給我你的電話號碼嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2226899 (CM) & #5689566 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2226899"},{"c":"Do you still have my phone number?","cn":"你還有我的電話號碼嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3821865 (CK) & #6120802 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3821865"}],"numerous":[{"c":"I have numerous books on my bookshelf.","cn":"我有大量的书在我的书架上。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1697745 (shanghainese) & #1695387 (Venki)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1697745"},{"c":"Tom had numerous girlfriends.","cn":"Tom有很多女友。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4493603 (CK) & #4504492 (egg0073)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4493603"}],"nurse":[{"c":"Can I speak to the head nurse?","cn":"我能跟護士長說話嗎?","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #318749 (CK) & #801400 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/318749"},{"c":"That nurse is very kind and polite.","cn":"那个护士人很好，又有礼貌。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #68475 (CK) & #463855 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/68475"}],"nursery":[{"c":"What's your favorite nursery rhyme?","cn":"你最喜歡的兒童歌曲是哪首？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #906832 (CK) & #6154358 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/906832"}]}
